    "updated_at": "2022-02-16T01:47:26Z",
    "body": "For mobile mode (i.e., not when you choose to load desktop sites, which is the default on iPadOS):\r\n\r\nMozilla/5.0 (**iPhone**; CPU iPhone OS **15_1** like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/605.1.15 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/**15.1** Mobile/15E148 Safari/604.1\r\n\r\n…where the bold bits change. (Unless I've messed up somehow.)",
